{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江美儀與郭柏妍（Rosita）因合作無綫劇集《下流上車族》飾演母女而結緣，劇集播出至今兩人感情依然深厚。江美儀即將於 9 月 20 日迎來生日，作為「乖女」的郭柏妍亦十分貼心，特意為「媽媽」提前慶祝生日。今日（15日），江美儀於社交平台分享了多張兩人的溫馨合照，母女情滿瀉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa9240de-17d9-4c84-9ebd-18fbb820beb6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026V7OYpLEJTz1789461166.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa9240de-17d9-4c84-9ebd-18fbb820beb6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c3df0246-a47c-41b2-ae96-0ddd8c23e0a1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026A4bTHMZqpC1789461166.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c3df0246-a47c-41b2-ae96-0ddd8c23e0a1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，江美儀與郭柏妍是次聚會均以簡約休閒服飾亮相，幾乎素顏上陣的她們依然保持極佳狀態。郭柏妍特意為「媽媽」準備了一個精緻的青葡萄生日蛋糕，二人更對著鏡頭嘟嘴賣萌，郭柏妍又親暱地靠在江美儀的肩膀上，互動宛如親生母女般自然甜蜜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9c02eccd-e372-4c6c-b1ef-6b19fc05c2d7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GmDCYf2Lrt1789461165.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9c02eccd-e372-4c6c-b1ef-6b19fc05c2d7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">溫馨相片曝光後，隨即勾起一眾劇迷的回憶。大批網民紛紛湧入留言區送上祝福並大讚：「車氏母女好有愛」、「祝美儀姐生日快樂」，亦有不少人感嘆「兩母女感情真係好好」，可見二人的好感情深受大眾喜愛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T09:00:33.513992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}